The libraries of ImageMagick 7 of azsupport/ports (JPEG, PNG, WebP, GIF, HEIC
and AVIF only): libMagickCore-7 and libMagickWand-7 in /usr/local/azsupport/lib with
their headers, .pc files and MagickWand-config (/usr/local/azsupport/bin), their
static build in /usr/local/azsupport/static (the static imagick of azsupport-ports.sh), and
etc/ImageMagick-7 with the policy of graphics/ImageMagick7/files/policy.xml,
which the libraries read. The programs are ImageMagick7 or ImageMagick67;
imagick7 of PHP links these libraries. Versions and options:
share/doc/ImageMagick7/VERSIONS.
